WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.010
Here is the quick version. Uploading your USTA files into TenAceIQ keeps results, player links, schedules, and team insights accurate and connected.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:15.570
Sign in to TennisLink, open Stats and Standings, then tap the blue link for your team.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:21.900
From Team Summary, tap Send to Excel and confirm Download. Repeat for Player Roster.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.360
For match results, open Match Summary, choose View Score, and download the scorecard.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.890
Now open TenAceIQ and tap the upload icon at the top right.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:38.890
Choose Scorecard for results, Player Roster for players and ratings, or Schedule for dates, opponents, and courts.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:45.770
Select the matching Excel file from Downloads. Review the details, then tap Looks right, import.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:52.740
Repeat for your other USTA files. Thank you for strengthening our data, tools, and tennis community.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:58.130
You are all set. Visit tenaceiq.com whenever you are ready.
